# Content-builder review

Teacher-edited and **approved** / **locked** sections survive regeneration.

- Read `content-builder/lessons/{CODE}/{lesson_id}/locks.json` before rewriting.
- Locked keys (for example `instruction.minds_on`, `questions.transfer`) are not replaced by specialists.
- Parent is the only agent that changes lock state after Shawn edits the review page.
- Regeneration rebuilds only unlocked sections. Say which sections were skipped because they were locked.
